Weights licence
===============

This file covers the two model files in this directory:

    rfbg_qknorm_ft_030500.pt
    sfbg_pre_020000.pt

They are NOT covered by the MIT licence in the repository root, which applies to
the source code only.

Released for non-commercial research use only.

These weights are derived from the HDTF and NoXI corpora. The terms under which
you obtained those corpora bind any use of these weights, and nothing here grants
rights that those terms withhold. They are reproduction artefacts trained at
reduced scale, not the models behind the paper's reported tables, and they are
provided without warranty of fitness for any downstream purpose.

